OL,3,GNEWSAJudge calls injunction case to
OL,4,Astop flags 'troubling'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA legal bid to stop members of
OL,7,Fanti-migrant group Raise the Colours
OL,8,Ffrom putting up flags in Birmingham has
OL,9,Fbeen adjourned after a judge called the
OL,10,Fcity council's case "troubling".
OL,12,FRaise the Colours were among those
OL,13,Fresponsible for draping swathes of the
OL,14,Fcity in Union and St George's Cross
OL,15,Fflags, leading to clashes with groups
OL,16,Fopposing the practice.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
