OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAJudge calls injunction case to
OL,4,Astop flags 'troubling'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council - run since the summer as a
OL,7,Fminority coalition led by the Liberal
OL,8,FDemocrats - is seeking an injunction
OL,9,Fwith regard to various individuals. It
OL,10,Fargues the flags present a threat to
OL,11,Fpublic safety, community cohesion and
OL,12,Falso road users, due to the banners'
OL,13,Fhigh-profile presence on street
OL,14,Ffurniture such as lampposts.
OL,16,FJudge Emma Kelly, sitting at Birmingham
OL,17,FCivil Courts on Tuesday, said there
OL,18,Fneeded to be greater clarity over
OL,19,Fallegations made against individuals
OL,20,Fnamed in the local authority's case.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
